OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity secures more than #1.3
OL,4,Afor campuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university has secured more than
OL,7,F#1.3m to develop teaching facilities at
OL,8,Fits campuses in Kent.
OL,10,FThe new London and South East
OL,11,FUniversity Group (LASE), which is the
OL,12,Fmerger of the universities of Kent and
OL,13,FGreenwich, says that the money has come
OL,14,Ffrom the Office for Students, an
OL,15,Findependent higher education regulator.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
