OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity secures more than #1.3
OL,4,Afor campuses
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe money is to help fund new digital
OL,7,Fand artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,8,Fteaching facilities in Canterbury, an
OL,9,Fengineering technology hub at its
OL,10,FMedway campus in Gillingham and
OL,11,Fspecialist equipment for a new creative
OL,12,Ftechnology centre at Historic Dockyard
OL,13,FChatham.
OL,15,FJane Harrington, founding
OL,16,Fvice-chancellor and chief executive of
OL,17,FLASE, said the investment would "make a
OL,18,Freal difference to our students".
